---
---

<section id="problema" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 w-full">
    <!-- Decorative vertical line -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1px] h-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/10 to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 mt-12">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
                El Riesgo Oculto
            </span>
            <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl text-primary">
                ¿Sabés cuánto le cuesta a tu empresa un cheque rechazado?
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary/60 font-light">
                No es solo el valor nominal del cheque. Es el reclamo judicial, las horas de gestión administrativa, el flujo de caja que se interrumpe y la incertidumbre de no saber si el próximo pago también va a rebotar.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
            
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-red-500/15 bg-gradient-to-b from-red-500/[0.03] to-white/60 p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-red-500/20 text-red-500 bg-red-500/10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm">
                    <svg class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary">Pérdida directa de capital</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary/60 font-light">
                    Monto total incobrable, sumado a costos de intimación, cartas documento, gastos de gestoría y honorarios legales.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-amber-500/15 bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/[0.03] to-white/60 p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm">
                    <svg class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary">Tiempo y horas perdidas</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary/60 font-light">
                    Días enteros persiguiendo libradores y bancos, desgastando al equipo administrativo que debería enfocarse en vender.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-orange-500/15 bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-500/[0.03] to-white/60 p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:border-orange-500/30 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                <div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-500 bg-orange-500/10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm">
                    <svg class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6L9 12.75l3-3 7.5 7.5M19.5 17.25h-6m6 0v-6" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary">Riesgo sistémico acumulado</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary/60 font-light">
                    Aceptar cheques a 30, 60 o 90 días sin cruce con la Central de Deudores BCRA convierte cada venta en una apuesta ciega.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-accent-brand/[0.06] border border-accent-brand/20">
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-primary font-medium">
                Con <strong class="text-accent font-bold">ChequeAR</strong> verificás la salud crediticia y los antecedentes bancarios <span class="underline decoration-accent-brand underline-offset-4 font-semibold">antes de entregar tu mercadería</span>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
